sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Браузер
  participant FE as frontend
  participant KC as Keycloak
  participant GW as api-gateway
  participant SL as service-logic
  participant H as Hasura

  B->>KC: OIDC PKCE
  KC-->>B: JWT
  B->>FE: UI
  FE->>GW: REST /api + Bearer
  GW->>KC: JWK verify
  GW->>SL: proxy
  SL->>H: admin GraphQL
  FE->>GW: GraphQL + JWT
  GW->>H: /v1/graphql
